' 4+1 logical view (code, C4 level 4) - Code (C4 level 4) · slot generation, «free» and a slot's price
' Version 1.1 - 2026-11-10
' For: whoever writes the code.
' Documented decision: Slots are calculated by SlotGenerator, never stored (ADR 0007); «free» and a slot's price each have a single definition.
' Not drawn: the components that call these classes.
@startuml logical-code-slots
!include ../style.puml
title Logical view - code (C4 level 4): slot generation, «free» and a slot's price

hide empty members

package "Dom/Scheduling" as CC_CLUBTIME {
  class "ClubTime" as CC_CLUBTIME_ClubTime <<static>> {
    + {static} ToUtc(date, time, timeZone) : DateTime
    + {static} ToLocal(utc, timeZone) : DateTime
    + {static} Today(timeProvider, timeZone) : DateOnly
  }
  class "OpeningHours" as CC_CLUBTIME_OpeningHours <<record>> {
    + Opens : TimeOnly
    + Closes : TimeOnly
    + ClosesAtMidnight : bool
    + UtcIntervalOn(date, timeZone) : (OpensAt, ClosesAt)
    + {static} AreValid(opens, closes) : bool
    + {static} Create(opens, closes) : OpeningHours
  }
  class "SlotDuration" as CC_CLUBTIME_SlotDuration <<record struct>> {
    + Minutes : int
    + Length : TimeSpan
    + {static} IsSupported(minutes) : bool
    + {static} FromMinutes(minutes) : SlotDuration
  }
  class "SlotGenerator" as CC_CLUBTIME_SlotGenerator <<static>> {
    + {static} Generate(date, hours, duration, timeZone) : IReadOnlyList<TimeSlot>
  }
  class "TimeSlot" as D_SLOT <<record>> {
    + StartsAtUtc : DateTime
    + EndsAtUtc : DateTime
    + HasStartedBy(nowUtc) : bool
  }
  class "BookingWindow" as CC_CLUBTIME_BookingWindow <<static>> {
    + {static} DaysAhead = 30
    + {static} Contains(date, today) : bool
  }
}

package "Dom/Pitches" {
  class "Pitch" as D_PITCH {
    + HoursOn(day) : OpeningHours?
    + SlotsOn(date, timeZone) : IReadOnlyList<TimeSlot>
    + SlotStartingAt(startsAtUtc, timeZone) : TimeSlot?
    + PriceForSlot(startsAtUtc, timeZone) : decimal
  }
  class "PitchPriceBand" as D_PRICEBAND {
    + Covers(day, time) : bool
  }
}

package "App/Pitches and App/Bookings" {
  class "PitchDayCalendar" as CC_DAYCAL {
    + SlotsAsync(pitches, date, ct) : Task<IReadOnlyDictionary<Guid, IReadOnlyList<DaySlot>>>
  }
  class "DaySlot" as CC_DAYCAL_DaySlot <<record>> {
    + Slot : TimeSlot
    + Blocked : bool
    + Booked : bool
    + IsFreeAt(nowUtc) : bool
  }
  class "PitchInZone" as CC_DAYCAL_PitchInZone <<record>> {
    + Pitch : Pitch
    + TimeZone : TimeZoneInfo
  }
  class "BookingSlotCheck" as CC_SLOTCHECK {
    + CheckAsync(pitch, timeZone, startsAt, now, ct) : Task<Result<TimeSlot>>
  }
}

D_PITCH --> CC_CLUBTIME_OpeningHours : HoursOn (from PitchOpeningDay)
D_PITCH ..> CC_CLUBTIME_SlotGenerator : SlotsOn calls Generate
D_PITCH ..> CC_CLUBTIME_ClubTime : SlotStartingAt and PriceForSlot: ToLocal
D_PITCH --> "0..20" D_PRICEBAND : PriceForSlot: the first one that Covers
CC_CLUBTIME_SlotGenerator ..> CC_CLUBTIME_OpeningHours : UtcIntervalOn
CC_CLUBTIME_SlotGenerator ..> CC_CLUBTIME_SlotDuration : Length
CC_CLUBTIME_SlotGenerator ..> D_SLOT : creates
CC_CLUBTIME_OpeningHours ..> CC_CLUBTIME_ClubTime : ToUtc
CC_DAYCAL ..> CC_DAYCAL_PitchInZone : receives
CC_DAYCAL ..> D_PITCH : SlotsOn
CC_DAYCAL ..> CC_DAYCAL_DaySlot : creates
CC_DAYCAL_DaySlot --> D_SLOT : HasStartedBy
CC_SLOTCHECK ..> D_PITCH : SlotStartingAt
CC_SLOTCHECK ..> CC_CLUBTIME_BookingWindow : Contains
CC_SLOTCHECK ..> CC_CLUBTIME_ClubTime : ToLocal, Today

note bottom of CC_CLUBTIME_SlotGenerator
  Consecutive slots of exact duration from opening,
  measured in real time between UTC instants:
  for (start = opensAt; start + length ≤ closesAt; start += length).
  25 h on 2026-10-25 and 23 h on 2026-03-29 in Lisbon.
end note

note bottom of CC_CLUBTIME_ClubTime
  A time that does not exist (clocks forward): moves forward past the gap
  (01:30 → 02:30 WEST). A repeated time (clocks back): the first
  occurrence (WEST). Closing 00:00 = midnight (next day).
end note

note bottom of CC_DAYCAL_DaySlot
  IsFreeAt = !Blocked && !Booked && !Slot.HasStartedBy(now):
  the single definition of «free» (owner preview,
  public slots, search). Blocked/Booked: any
  half-open overlap with a block or a
  Confirmed booking (one query of each for all pitches).
end note

@enduml
